          "required": {
            "context": ["extensions.https://legend-meta.com/xapi/ext/sessionId", "extensions.https://legend-meta.com/xapi/ext/unitType"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "https://legend-meta.com/xapi/templates/item-hint",
          "name": { "zh-CN": "题目提示请求事件", "en-US": "item hint request" },
          "verb": "https://legend-meta.com/xapi/verbs/requested-hint",
          "objectTypeRequirement": { "objectType": "Activity" },
          "required": {
            "context": [
              "extensions.https://legend-meta.com/xapi/ext/sessionId",
              "extensions.https://legend-meta.com/xapi/ext/unitType",
              "extensions.https://legend-meta.com/xapi/ext/hint"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "https://legend-meta.com/xapi/templates/item-explanation",
          "name": { "zh-CN": "题目解析查看事件", "en-US": "item explanation viewed" },
          "verb": "https://legend-meta.com/xapi/verbs/viewed-explanation",
          "objectTypeRequirement": { "objectType": "Activity" },
          "required": {
            "context": [
              "extensions.https://legend-meta.com/xapi/ext/sessionId",
              "extensions.https://legend-meta.com/xapi/ext/unitType",
              "extensions.https://legend-meta.com/xapi/ext/explanation"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "notes": [
      "题目实体建议作为 ActivityType=item，并作为object.id；这样题目行为不会和五类学习单元混淆。",
      "attempted-item/answered-item/passed-item/failed-item 这组动词与 xAPI 生态常用的 attempted/answered/passed/failed 概念一致，但这里用“item后缀”避免与你现有 interact 的 attempted/succeeded/failed-action 语义冲突。",
      "如果你希望更贴近标准生态，也可以直接使用 answered/passed/failed 并通过 object.definition.type=item 来区分（但你现在已有大量自定义verbs，保留 item 后缀更清晰）。"
    ]
  }
}


